      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسلق</span></b> , said of a man, <i>His camel's back
became white after the healing of galls.</i> (TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>He hunted, snared,</i> or <i>trapped, a she-wolf,</i> (IAar. K,) which is called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْقَة</span>. (IAar.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also 1, in the latter half of the paragraph.

